<title>UK: European gold starts week with more losses.</title>
<headline>European gold starts week with more losses.</headline>
<text>
<p>Gold - slipped further to open at $318.85/$319.35 an ounce vs $324.25/$324.75 after falling to 12-year lows last week in the wake of Australian gold reserve sales.</p>
<p>Silver - begins at $4.51/$4.53 vs $4.54/$4.56.</p>
<p>Platinum - $418.00/$422.00 vs $419.00/$422.00.</p>
<p>Palladium - slips three dollars to $187.00/$191.00.</p>
